{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/72d726dd7f631abb86365f4de63939d3.avif?t=1760080991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras_big/72d726dd7f631abb86365f4de63939d3.webp?t=1760080991 width=1560 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/0db04eda9f5d73a6f4c860e13f9829ae.poster.avif?t=1760080991\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/0db04eda9f5d73a6f4c860e13f9829ae.webm?t=1760080991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/0db04eda9f5d73a6f4c860e13f9829ae.mp4?t=1760080991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twins of the Sun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two siblings. One mission. A kidnapped sister waiting to be rescued. Twins of the Sun is a colorful action-adventure game that blends fast-paced hack-and-slash combat with a story about courage, teamwork, and the bonds of family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/3d2c53f98e79c7b731e8b023635605c1.avif?t=1760080991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras_big/3d2c53f98e79c7b731e8b023635605c1.webp?t=1760080991 width=1560 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the twins\u2019 peaceful life is shattered by the kidnapping of their youngest sister, they set out on a dangerous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their path leads through:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush jungles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bustling villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treacherous mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious temples of the old gods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location brings new enemies, unique challenges, and bosses that will test your timing and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/667bcac2599d1f8c710246a1031a0571.avif?t=1760080991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras_big/667bcac2599d1f8c710246a1031a0571.webp?t=1760080991 width=1560 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines accessible hack-and-slash combat with the fun of local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play \u2013 control both twins in turn and guide them through the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op \u2013 invite a friend and complete the entire campaign together, sharing combat and exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main weapon is the mighty Stone Hammer, but along the way you can obtain the Wand of the Gods, granting powerful ranged magic attacks. Temporary power-ups add variety and keep battles dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/b2fa98b8b15bb11a37451237980ed5d7.avif?t=1760080991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras_big/b2fa98b8b15bb11a37451237980ed5d7.webp?t=1760080991 width=1560 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 handcrafted stages \u2013 filled with combat, exploration, and variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack-and-slash action \u2013 fast, readable gameplay suitable for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two heroes on one journey \u2013 play solo or team up in local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss battles \u2013 challenging encounters that push your skills to the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, cartoony presentation \u2013 appealing and stream-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly tone \u2013 accessible for younger and older players alike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/e8c657bec47931ea5fc51ff9ae6124c0.avif?t=1760080991\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras_big/e8c657bec47931ea5fc51ff9ae6124c0.webp?t=1760080991 width=1560 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players looking for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action game that\u2019s easy to pick up but hard to put down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun co-op adventure to enjoy on the couch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthearted, family-friendly experience with exciting battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018910/extras/2e2faa87f9dbb35e7a994548e2a42279.poster.avif?t=1760080991\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka